1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,200
The Magic Words with Mimo!

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:12,107
Mimo: Hi friends! Did you know there are magic words? They're not for magic tricks. They're for being kind!

3
00:00:12,407 --> 00:00:18,130
Mimo: When we use magic words, everybody feels happy. Let's learn them together!

4
00:00:19,734 --> 00:00:22,836
Bruno: Cookies! Give me a cookie! Give me, give me!

5
00:00:24,397 --> 00:00:27,493
Mimo: Hmm. Bruno, what's the magic word?

6
00:00:29,793 --> 00:00:33,774
Mimo: Friends, can you help Bruno? What's the magic word?

7
00:00:35,674 --> 00:00:37,784
Bruno: Oh! Please! May I have a cookie, please?

8
00:00:38,084 --> 00:00:39,585
Mimo: Of course you may!

9
00:00:39,885 --> 00:00:43,609
Mimo: And when somebody gives you something, what do you say?

10
00:00:45,509 --> 00:00:46,708
Bruno: Thank you, Mimo!

11
00:00:47,008 --> 00:00:48,825
Mimo: You're welcome, Bruno!

12
00:00:51,899 --> 00:00:53,830
Lulu: I'm reading my favorite book.

13
00:00:56,713 --> 00:00:59,521
Lulu: Ouch! Bruno, you bumped into me!

14
00:00:59,821 --> 00:01:02,007
Bruno: Oh no! What should I say, friends?

15
00:01:03,907 --> 00:01:06,254
Bruno: I'm sorry, Lulu. Are you okay?

16
00:01:06,554 --> 00:01:09,442
Lulu: I'm okay. Thank you for saying sorry!

17
00:01:09,742 --> 00:01:13,675
Mimo: When we say sorry, we help our friends feel better.

18
00:01:16,596 --> 00:01:19,350
Pip: I want to get to the cookies, but Bruno is in the way!

19
00:01:21,043 --> 00:01:22,965
Mimo: Pip, what can you say?

20
00:01:24,665 --> 00:01:26,291
Pip: Excuse me, Bruno!

21
00:01:26,591 --> 00:01:28,034
Bruno: Oh! Of course, Pip!

22
00:01:29,430 --> 00:01:34,996
Mimo: Uh oh. Look! There's only one cookie left, and two friends want it!

23
00:01:35,296 --> 00:01:36,478
Pip: I want the cookie!

24
00:01:36,778 --> 00:01:38,127
Bruno: I want the cookie too!

25
00:01:40,427 --> 00:01:43,519
Mimo: Hmm. What can we do, friends?

26
00:01:45,219 --> 00:01:48,896
Mimo: We can share! Let's break the cookie in half.

27
00:01:49,196 --> 00:01:50,986
Pip: Half for you, and half for me!

28
00:01:51,286 --> 00:01:53,565
Bruno: Sharing is caring! Thank you, Pip!

29
00:01:53,865 --> 00:01:54,954
Pip: You're welcome!

30
00:01:55,254 --> 00:01:58,791
Mimo: Let's say all the magic words together! Ready?

31
00:01:59,091 --> 00:01:59,651
Bruno: Please!

32
00:02:00,351 --> 00:02:01,194
Pip: Thank you!

33
00:02:01,894 --> 00:02:02,746
Lulu: Sorry!

34
00:02:03,446 --> 00:02:04,657
Pip: Excuse me!

35
00:02:05,357 --> 00:02:06,836
Mimo: And let's share!

36
00:02:08,436 --> 00:02:14,600
Mimo: Great job, friends! Use your magic words every day, and you'll make everybody smile!

37
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:16,506
Bruno: Please may I have another cookie?

38
00:02:18,806 --> 00:02:20,696
Mimo: Bye bye, friends!
